Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:03.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(424,488)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.30,0:01:15.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大老远从面包店运过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:15.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All the way from the bakery
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.42,0:01:16.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过一切都值得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:16.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it'll be all worth it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为蟹黄堡马上就要到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when I finally get my hands on a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.42,0:01:23.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开始行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:23.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we go
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.20,0:01:33.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:33.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他朝着大门走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's headed for the front door
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.94,0:01:37.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在正好撤出去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:37.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to make my exit
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.19,0:01:38.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:38.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here ya go, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.28,0:01:41.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特别的蟹黄堡给特别的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:41.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A special Krabby Patty for a special friend
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.24,0:01:42.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真谢谢你  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:42.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thanks, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.94,0:01:44.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我感激不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:44.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I sure am obliged
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.20,0:01:45.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我很爱蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:45.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love these things
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.27,0:01:47.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是吃起来可有点不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:47.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but it's always a little tricky eatin' one
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.80,0:01:48.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:48.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.77,0:01:50.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:50.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.66,0:01:52.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:52.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.75,0:02:04.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有水
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:04.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No water
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.65,0:02:05.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没法呼吸了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:05.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't breathe
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来脱掉这身臭玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to get this stinky thing off
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.32,0:02:29.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太难闻了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:29.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, that's ripe
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.90,0:02:38.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:38.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.18,0:02:41.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗澡洗澡擦擦擦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:41.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A-scrub, scrub, scrub in the tub, tub, tub
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.82,0:02:45.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那到底什么恶心的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:45.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in Neptune's ocean is that repulsive thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗一把热水澡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothin' like a hot shower
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.78,0:02:49.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最能让我这只松鼠焕然一新了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:49.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to make a squirrel feel like a new woman
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪奇克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy Cheeks?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可她毛哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But where's her fur?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.10,0:02:56.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:56.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.19,0:02:57.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下可算找到办法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:57.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I've just found out
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.87,0:03:02.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以一劳永逸偷到蟹黄堡秘方了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:03:02.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how to get the Krabby Patty formula once and for all
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.53,0:03:05.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:05.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Getting clean
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.62,0:03:06.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,身上没跳蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:06.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No fleas on me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm getting clean
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.20,0:03:13.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢洗个久点的澡  松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:13.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hope you like long showers, squirrel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(602,688)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.34,0:03:18.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是出意外了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:18.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Was there an accident?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.57,0:03:19.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:19.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:27.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338,206)}厨房
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.30,0:03:22.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个东西可以带我们偷到蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our ticket to the Krabby Patty formula
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's what that is
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.41,0:03:24.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你该不会是认真的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:24.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.15,0:03:27.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,认真得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:27.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As serious as a shark attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在该来拧干我的臭毛衣了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to wring out my stinky fur coat
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.89,0:03:36.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:36.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in tarnation?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.55,0:03:38.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可能是落在外面了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:38.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I left it outside
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.65,0:03:41.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我被反锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:41.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm locked in
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.68,0:03:46.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,某个下流的害虫偷了我东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:46.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some low-life varmint stole my things
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.24,0:03:47.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还私闯我家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:47.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and broke into my home
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My home
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.35,0:03:52.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要逮到那坏种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:52.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get that son of a guitar picker
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.12,0:04:01.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦  祝我好运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:01.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Karen, wish me luck
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.35,0:04:03.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:03.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Repulsive
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下一定会奏效
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is gonna work like a charm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.45,0:04:14.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别到处乱站  呆头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:14.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're standing, coral brains
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.78,0:04:16.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:16.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.11,0:04:17.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你样子好像不太舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:17.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't look so good
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好别去海之霸吃东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got to stop eating at the chum bucket
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.26,0:04:20.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那种玩意会腐蚀掉你的内脏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:20.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That stuff will rot your insides
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lies, lies
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最爱的餐厅永远都是海之霸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The chum bucket will always be my favorite restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.65,0:04:28.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪  你这语气不太对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:28.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy, you don't sound like yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  珊迪一点都没变
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, Sandy is herself
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.57,0:04:37.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全没有理由怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:37.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No reason to be suspicious in any way, y'all
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.10,0:04:39.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那只要没理由怀疑就行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:39.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as there's no reason to be suspicious
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚才真是好险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was close
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.75,0:04:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,德克萨斯腔得多练练
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to perfect that Texas drawl
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(474,390)}公交站
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.72,0:04:53.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老兄你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:53.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy, partner
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.37,0:05:00.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪  你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:05:00.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy, you're back
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.15,0:05:03.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  之前那蟹黄堡真是太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:03.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, that Krabby Patty was so darn good
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我非得看你怎么做不可
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to see how you make one
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.57,0:05:08.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪  你样子有点不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:08.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, Sandy, you look different
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.87,0:05:11.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是在说什么  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:11.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What're y'all talking about, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我明明就是你老朋友  还有毛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's yer ole pal in the living fur
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.97,0:05:19.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  可是你好像哪里不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:19.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but something about you is different
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但就是指不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just can't put my finger on it
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千万别指出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please don't put your finger on it
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.03,0:05:23.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:23.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没穿宇航服戴头盔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not wearing your space suit and helmet
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.32,0:05:26.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:26.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.96,0:05:27.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:27.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cause, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在会在水下呼吸了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just breathe underwater now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get cookin'
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.32,0:05:40.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这新鲜绵软的东西正是蟹黄堡肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:40.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The gooey freshness that is the Krabby Patty Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先打住  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me stop you there, squarepants
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.02,0:05:44.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有劳你跟我说说看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:44.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd be much obliged to know
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.69,0:05:46.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个肉饼是怎么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:46.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how y'all make one of them there patties
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No can do, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会泄露秘密配方的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That would require revealing the secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.37,0:05:56.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我目前的劳动合同明令禁止那种行为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:54.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and that is explicitly forbidden
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:56.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as per my current labor contract
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:57.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(570,728)}蟹堡王工业劳动协议
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  但我可是你好朋友珊迪奇克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but this is yer old buddy Sandy cheeks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:03.67,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1152,732)}德州腔
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.90,0:06:03.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们两个的友情亲密得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:03.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, you and me are as closer 'n two catfish in a skillet
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.35,0:06:08.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,934.44-929b条款
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:08.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,section 934.44-929b
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.63,0:06:12.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明确禁止将秘方泄露给朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:10.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,specifically prohibits the disclosure
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:12.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of the secret formula to friends
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.62,0:06:14.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,即便朋友的友情有如下所说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:14.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,even when those friends are quote
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亲密得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Closer 'n two catfish in a skillet"
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.72,0:06:18.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我诅咒你  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:18.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Curse you, krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.14,0:06:20.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我可以给你展示其他所有细节
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:20.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I can show you all the other ins and outs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.52,0:06:22.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,助你做出热气腾腾的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:22.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of making a steamy Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.59,0:06:24.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,首先  要确保
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:24.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First, I make sure
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.63,0:06:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烤架的温度维持在舒适的274度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm at the comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,grilling temperature of 274 degrees
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在要开烤了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now we are guh-rilling
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.66,0:06:34.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,煎肉饼大约需要多久
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:34.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And approximately how long do you cook a patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.45,0:06:37.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡肉饼每面都要正好煎283秒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:36.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A Krabby Patty is cooked for exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,283 seconds on each side
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.83,0:06:40.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,283秒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:40.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,283 seconds
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,居然能直接从源头得到情报
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm getting all this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,straight from the source
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.63,0:06:45.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还能再容易到哪去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:45.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How could this get any easier?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先把蟹黄堡的秘密配方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm puttin' the secret Krabby Patty formula
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放到显而易见的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out in plain sight
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.62,0:06:55.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  总之呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:55.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先把秘方放这  我清理一下保险箱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna leave it out here while I clean out the safe
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.55,0:07:00.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别让它远离你视线  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:00.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't let it out of your sight, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,包在我身上  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can always count on me, Mr. K
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho, man
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.05,0:07:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密配方唾手可得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That secret formula is as good as mine
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.50,0:07:14.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偷走我毛皮的坏蛋一定来过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:14.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The no-good who nabbed my pelt surely came here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.72,0:07:16.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多半是想把它卖到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:16.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Probably wanted to cash it in
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村黑市里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on the bikini bottom black market
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.66,0:07:20.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非抓到那坏蛋不可  让他没法得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:20.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, not if I catch that varmint first
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你  有没有看到这附近有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You, ya seen anybody in these parts
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.67,0:07:25.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拖着毛皮到处跑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:25.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,haulin' a fur pelt?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  光溜溜的花栗鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look it, a naked chipmunk
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.29,0:07:34.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花栗鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:34.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chipmunk?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我毛皮失窃有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is so funny about getting my fur stole?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.77,0:07:42.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你身上的粉红鼠肉走光不嫌害臊吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:39.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ashamed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:42.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of having your pink rat flesh exposed?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.39,0:07:43.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:43.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.11,0:07:46.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被这么多人盯着  那个可恶的偷毛贼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:46.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With this much attention, that no-good fur thief
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.55,0:07:48.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定远远地就会发现我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:48.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will see me comin' a mile away
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.60,0:07:51.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好先找个东西遮羞一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:51.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I best find somethin' to cover my hind end
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.14,0:08:00.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在去把坏蛋抓回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:08:00.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to go catch me some scum
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在开始烤了  就可以准备配料了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that we're grillin', we can work on the fixings
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.10,0:08:05.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看  这边有两个肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:05.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See, there are two patties here
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.15,0:08:08.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但在切配料之前呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:08.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But before we get into slicing and dicing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.47,0:08:10.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都要先洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:10.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we always start with the washing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.67,0:08:12.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先开始洗海草
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:12.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll begin with the seaweed
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.07,0:08:16.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  我站那边看清楚点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:16.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll stand on that side for a better view
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.87,0:08:19.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以  不过要注意了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:19.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okeydokey, but pay close attention
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.15,0:08:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干净是公众对抗终身恶疾的最后防线
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for cleanliness is the public's last defense
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:23.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,against a life of horrible disease
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.17,0:08:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在那
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There it is
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刷子务必要充分覆满肥皂泡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Always ensure that your brush is adequately lathered
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.15,0:08:29.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后认真仔细清理表面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:29.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then thoroughly clean the surface
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.48,0:08:33.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两面都得清理干净
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:33.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Always making sure to get both sides
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.35,0:08:34.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:34.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's nice
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.75,0:08:36.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:36.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Almost there
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.70,0:08:40.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接着放到干燥架上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:40.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then lay it down onto the drying rack
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就可以开始干燥环节了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and we'll engage our drying phase
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.05,0:08:44.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咋了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:44.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了  不能吹太久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember, never overdry
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.25,0:08:49.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然海草会变脆  还会裂开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:49.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the seaweed becomes brittle and cracks
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.21,0:08:55.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个死贼一定就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That dastardly rustler's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:55.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,got to be somewhere in these parts
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.04,0:09:01.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  没毛的山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:01.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, a hairless goat
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:08.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(520,142)}报社
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.92,0:09:11.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,稳着点  稳着点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:11.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Steady, steady
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.08,0:09:12.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:12.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.02,0:09:15.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偏离中心3.6毫米了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:15.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're off-center by 3.6 millimeters
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.12,0:09:16.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再试一次吧  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:16.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try it again, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,越来越烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is getting so tedious
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许你该再演示个几遍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should demonstrate a few more times
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好让我多熟悉一下门道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so I can get the hang of it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.60,0:09:31.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然也可以直接指出你出问题的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:31.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or we could address your problem areas directly
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.68,0:09:33.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是最后手腕不容易轻轻放上去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:33.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you struggling with the final wrist flick?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是说你一开始拿的动作不太会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or is your difficulty with the initial transfer move?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不想再跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of running
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是该正面迎战了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to take a stand
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.47,0:09:45.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,暴露狂雪貂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:45.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A nudist ferret
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.60,0:09:47.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快上车  小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:47.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get in the car, kids
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.94,0:09:49.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:49.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.75,0:09:50.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:50.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.52,0:09:51.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:51.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好跑地底隐蔽一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I better go underground
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要想抓到这坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I'm ever gonna catch this thug
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.45,0:10:05.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须要找帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:05.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need some help
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.07,0:10:09.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是偏离了这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:09.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Still off by that much
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try it again
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.96,0:10:13.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:13.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try again
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.84,0:10:15.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:15.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try again
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.83,0:10:17.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:17.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try again
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.03,0:10:20.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:20.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try again
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.83,0:10:23.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:23.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try again
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.65,0:10:26.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你自个来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:26.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You try it again
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要动手了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm makin' my move
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总算到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's finally mine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.95,0:10:36.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在开到四爪狂奔模式
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:36.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to kick this baby into four-claw drive
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.83,0:10:38.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别走  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:38.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.78,0:10:39.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这问题能解决的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:39.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can work this out
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的毛皮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My pelt
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.15,0:10:48.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪把秘方拐走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:48.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy's makin' off with the formula
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪  你光着身子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy, you're naked
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一丝不挂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you don't have any clothes on
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.00,0:10:56.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放开我的毛皮  你这不明害虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:56.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unhand my pelt, you unknown varmint
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.25,0:10:58.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等你击垮我再说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:58.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only from my cold, dead feelers
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.84,0:10:59.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:10:59.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早该知道是你搞的鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I should have known this was your doin'
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.96,0:11:03.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在尝尝这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:03.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now feel this
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.27,0:11:12.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:12.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got ya
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,送你个特别适合你的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now for the appropriate punishment
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.77,0:11:19.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,专治你这样的小坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.77,0:11:19.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for a no-good, yella belly like yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.99,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(688,750)}芥末酱
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.83,0:11:21.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:21.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My eye
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.25,0:11:25.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这调料害我眼睛疼死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:25.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This condiment is highly irritating to my eye
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.57,0:11:27.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:27.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.95,0:11:30.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:30.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.85,0:11:33.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们会把那个坏蛋从你手里带走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:33.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll take that sicko off your hands
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.62,0:11:35.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,警察  谢天谢地你们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:35.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cops, thank goodness you're here
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把坏蛋带走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take the sicko away
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.02,0:11:40.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实这坏蛋就是你  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:40.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, we're referring to you, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.82,0:11:44.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在公共场合裸体违反了本县法律
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:44.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Public nudity is against the law in this county
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.44,0:11:45.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:45.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But don't fret
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.62,0:11:49.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你穿囚服一定很好看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:49.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll look just fine in prison orange
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:53.85,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,心灵相通
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:56.36,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:56.36,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:58.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:58.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(393.575,408)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:58.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(513.742,662)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:01.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:01.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:05.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(534,846)}海之霸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:12.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(502,698)}海草薯片
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.47,0:12:12.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就是美好生活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:12.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the life
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.25,0:12:15.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:15.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.65,0:12:16.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还在看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:16.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was watching that
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经烦透你整天无所事事傻坐着了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I'm tired of watching you sit around all day
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,承认吧  海之霸废透了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Admit it, the chum bucket is a total failure
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is not
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.17,0:12:25.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是生意比较清淡而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:25.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Business is just slow
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你听了我的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you'd take my advice
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.13,0:12:30.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方早到你手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.13,0:12:30.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Krabby Patty recipe would be yours
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.67,0:12:32.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就凭你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:32.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.72,0:12:34.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不过一电脑罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:34.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're just a computer
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.36,0:12:36.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在这可是邪恶天才
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:36.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the evil genius around here
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.92,0:12:39.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到了  儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:39.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is it, son
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.15,0:12:40.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海之霸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:40.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the chum bucket
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.52,0:12:43.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来这废透了的地方来客人了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:43.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like this failure has a customer
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.07,0:12:44.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:44.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.78,0:12:45.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,迷路了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:45.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you lost?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们没迷路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, we're not lost
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟儿子保证过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promised my boy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.33,0:12:50.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天要带他来海之霸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:50.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd take him to the chum bucket today
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.33,0:12:50.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:50.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:53.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,226)}点餐
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.67,0:12:53.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看那点餐窗口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:53.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at that order window
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.65,0:12:56.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布满了灰尘跟污垢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:56.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's completely covered in grime and filth
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,酷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cool
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.98,0:13:00.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闻闻那空气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:00.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Smell that air
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我好想吐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It makes me want to hurl
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.55,0:13:08.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海之霸应该就是我们旅行的高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:08.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think the chum bucket is the high point of our tour
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的旅行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your tour?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.01,0:13:09.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:09.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.93,0:13:13.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们在参观裤头村最恶心的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:10.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're visiting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:13.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the most disgusting places in bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.52,0:13:16.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目前为止你们是第一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:16.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And so far, you're number one
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了  肮脏的小不点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Farewell, you filthy little fella
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.52,0:13:21.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来去看城市垃圾场好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:21.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do ya say we try the city dump next?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.29,0:13:22.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.29,0:13:22.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So how'd it go?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.90,0:13:26.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:26.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是个大废物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm such a failure
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.86,0:13:29.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你认输吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:29.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, do you give up?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.61,0:13:30.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:30.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会照我说的做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll do what I tell you now?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你下面就要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's all you have to do
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.45,0:13:37.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想要蟹黄堡秘方  就去找写秘方的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.45,0:13:37.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want the patty recipe, then go to the man who wrote it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:37.87,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(920,708)}蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.87,0:13:39.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尤金蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.87,0:13:39.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eugene krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.00,0:13:39.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:39.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.85,0:13:41.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我以前怎么就没想到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:41.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of that before?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了我的心灵相通机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With my mind connector
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.12,0:13:45.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就能读老螃蟹的心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:45.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to read krabs' mind
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.37,0:13:49.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把秘方直接传输到你的小小的大脑里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:46.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,transferring the recipe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:49.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,directly into your teeny, tiny, little brain
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.49,0:13:52.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是个好办法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:52.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty good idea
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.67,0:13:56.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯  凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:56.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,K-Karen?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.39,0:13:58.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:13:58.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold still
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.17,0:14:00.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会需要这个的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:00.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll need this
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.69,0:14:05.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么连上老螃蟹的大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:05.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And just how am I supposed to attach it to krabs' brain?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,交给我  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Leave that to me, hon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备发射
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prepare for launch
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:10.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332,304)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目标在射程中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Target in range
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.83,0:14:13.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,发射程序启动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:13.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Launch sequence initiated
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.87,0:14:14.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:14.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他在那
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There he is
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.66,0:14:19.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:19.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.17,0:14:21.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:21.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.04,0:14:22.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:22.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Move it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.71,0:14:26.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:26.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're mine
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要把你的等身纸板模型放哪  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where do you want this life-size cutout of you, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早交代过你别玩那东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told ya to stop playin' with that thing
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.36,0:14:38.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快回去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:38.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and get back to work
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.35,0:14:42.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:42.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.66,0:14:44.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:44.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton, what happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.22,0:14:47.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你瞄得可真准啊  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:47.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your brilliant aim, honey
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.17,0:14:50.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我困在那白痴厨子里了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:50.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck inside that fool of a fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亲爱的  改变计划就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, honey, you'll just have to change plans
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连接他眼睛  看看外面情况
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plug into his eyes and see what's going on outside
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  保险丝烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward, we blew a fuse
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.24,0:15:07.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再不上菜  我就要怒火中烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:07.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow a fuse if you don't get that order up
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.12,0:15:09.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:09.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It works
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.31,0:15:12.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝看到的我都看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:12.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can see everything SpongeBob sees
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.27,0:15:13.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁来开下灯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:13.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can somebody hit the lights?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  17号餐的蟹黄堡在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, where's the Krabby Patty for order 17?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.62,0:15:17.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:17.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.03,0:15:19.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面好黑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.03,0:15:19.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's so dark in here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.07,0:15:20.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:20.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.15,0:15:21.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就不能把蟹黄堡端出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:21.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you just get the Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.16,0:15:26.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份蟹黄堡马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:26.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One Krabby Patty coming up
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.15,0:15:29.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他要在我眼前做蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:29.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's going to make a Krabby Patty right in front of me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肉饼在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where are those patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.90,0:15:31.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:31.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.27,0:15:32.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:32.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.02,0:15:35.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到你了  肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.02,0:15:35.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, patty
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.34,0:15:37.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再这样放个软面包
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:37.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Add one fluffy bun like so
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挤上一点特制酱料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a squirt of special sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.62,0:15:41.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特制酱料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:41.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Special sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下  洗洁精是特制酱料吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, soap is the special sauce?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.67,0:15:45.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后再拿点生菜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:45.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then you grab yourself some lettuce
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.97,0:15:49.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:49.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And voila
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份完美的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One perfect Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但愿能看到它有多美
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I only wish I could see how beautiful it looks
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,17号  你的蟹黄堡好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Number 17, your patty is ready
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走路小心点  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch your step, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里黑不溜秋的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is pitch black out here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.64,0:16:00.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不理解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:00.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.36,0:16:01.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也懒得理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:01.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:01.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(818,476)}酷炫豪宅
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,17号餐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order number 17
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.19,0:16:06.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,17号餐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:06.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order number 17?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,17号
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order 17?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.48,0:16:09.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:09.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.99,0:16:11.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是
