Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are those eardrums?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.21,0:16:34.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,灯又亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:34.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The lights are back on
