Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:41.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.42,0:16:42.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救救我  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:42.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help me, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.55,0:16:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我忘了怎么做蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten how to make krabby patties
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你再告诉我一遍秘方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please tell me the secret recipe again
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于找到耳膜了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, the ear drum
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.64,0:16:54.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在把这东西拔了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:54.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll just unplug this thing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.03,0:16:56.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要复习一遍吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:56.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Need a little refresher, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.50,0:16:57.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:57.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就再帮你过一遍蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll run through the Krabby Patty formula one more time
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.79,0:17:10.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听听看能收到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:10.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me see what I can tune in here
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.29,0:17:15.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方的秘密就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:15.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The secret of the Krabby Patty formula is
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.06,0:17:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中奖了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jackpot
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.40,0:17:18.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:18.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.62,0:17:21.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方的秘密就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:21.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the secret to the Krabby Patty formula is
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.84,0:17:23.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能请你再说大声点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:23.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could you speak a little louder, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方的秘密就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The secret to the Krabby Patty formula is
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.56,0:17:26.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:26.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.60,0:17:27.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:27.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.25,0:17:30.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:30.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here it comes
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.40,0:17:36.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方的秘密就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:36.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The secret to the Krabby Patty formula is
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.53,0:17:43.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我恨死我这一生了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.53,0:17:43.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate my life
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这东西够大声了没
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this thing loud enough?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.82,0:17:47.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然  我听得清清楚楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:47.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure, I can hear you fine now
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.67,0:17:48.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚问什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:48.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What was the question again?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.18,0:17:50.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:50.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It, uh--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.94,0:17:52.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:52.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you know, I don't remember
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.80,0:17:53.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:53.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me neither
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.85,0:17:54.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以没事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.85,0:17:54.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So we good?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.58,0:17:55.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:55.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.43,0:17:55.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:55.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.90,0:17:56.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:56.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.82,0:17:59.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五感都不重要  不用管了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:17:59.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enough with these petty carnal senses
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.46,0:18:01.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真想找到蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:01.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to get the Krabby Patty recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.69,0:18:04.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得直接去命令中枢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.69,0:18:04.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to go to command central
