Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:25.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Personal opinions?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,敲门笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Knock-knock jokes?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.37,0:18:29.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:29.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.54,0:18:31.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一点用都没
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:31.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is all useless
