Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:33.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to go in deeper
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.00,0:18:39.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:39.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.40,0:18:53.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴都会把秘密藏哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:53.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where do morons keep all their secrets?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.92,0:18:56.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:56.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.85,0:19:02.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这小子就没秘密吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:02.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this kid have any secrets?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.65,0:19:04.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:04.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The library
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.91,0:19:07.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所有想法都会在这留档
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:07.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where he keeps records of his every thought
