Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.32,0:19:13.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他所有最深最有料的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:13.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All of his deepest, juiciest secrets
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,竟然还按字母顺序排  也太方便了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In convenient alphabetical order
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at that
