Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Q"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.22,0:19:21.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,R
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:21.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"r"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.99,0:19:22.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,S
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:22.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"s"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.89,0:19:27.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让章鱼哥恼怒的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:27.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Sounds that make Squidward upset"?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.37,0:19:35.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星最喜欢被挠痒的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:35.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Patrick's favorite places to be scratched"?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.55,0:19:38.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:38.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.02,0:19:40.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挠痒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:40.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Scratching
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.60,0:19:43.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这秘密都太没劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:43.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All of these secrets are lame
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.75,0:19:45.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:45.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.32,0:19:47.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:47.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.49,0:19:51.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密配方不在大脑里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.49,0:19:51.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The secret recipe isn't in the brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.67,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,232)}蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而是在心里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's located in the heart
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.75,0:19:54.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太俗了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:54.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How cheesy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.55,0:20:06.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:06.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krabby Patty recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.34,0:20:09.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:09.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here it is
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的嘴在流口水
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My mouth is watering
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.65,0:20:15.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的味蕾隐隐作痛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:15.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My taste buds are tingling
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.25,0:20:20.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:20.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.00,0:20:22.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:22.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It feels so good
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.74,0:20:25.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到它一路直冲我手指
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:25.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can feel it all the way to my finger
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.70,0:20:26.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:26.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stumps
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.32,0:20:30.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所有配料完美和谐地聚在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All of the ingredients
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:30.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,coming together in perfect harmony
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.20,0:20:31.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全都归我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:31.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's all mine
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.82,0:20:38.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:38.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, that was weird
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚刚说到  蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like I was saying, the Krabby Patty recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.67,0:20:44.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是蟹堡王专有的美味财产
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:44.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is the delicious sole property of the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.60,0:20:46.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁说的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:46.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
